Initial understanding and intended architecture for Ripple (Track 2)

Ripple links a code change to downstream data consequences using Entire Graph
(changed symbol, callers, data flows), Entire Checkpoints (intent) and a
Databricks-executed comparison of old vs new transformation over one snapshot.

This is the pre-implementation checkpoint: intent, planned architecture, MVP
scope and the Curveball procedure checklist are recorded in BUILDATHON.md and
progress.md. No product code exists yet.

